All Things Devours, by "half sick of shadows" (Toby Ord), IFComp 2004, release 3 (serial 050325), the
post-competition release: a story file for the Z-machine (version 5), played on Zenix with frotz (docs/man/frotz.txt).

Licence: public domain. The author's words, from the game's source (games/source/inform/devours.inf at the IF
Archive) and its banner: "This program was written by Toby Ord (half sick of shadows) and has been released into
the public domain, so you are legally free to be distribute and modify it as you see fit." and "It is in the public
domain and may thus be freely copied or modified." The story file carries the Inform 6 library it was compiled with
(Graham Nelson's); Inform's terms have never restricted the games compiled with it.

devours.z5: https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/devours.z5, 160,768 bytes, sha256
a0b0569c2f57a975f868242b9a1dfe400a75e6aef92d5480eb51c81a3150eb37 (fetched 2026-11-14), unchanged. On Zenix:
/usr/share/games/frotz/devours.z5 (the games package); this notice is /usr/share/licenses/devours.
